,"caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/alex-hatch"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-7NB","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/09\/Header-v1-_-Photo-Blog-%402x.png?fit=1535%2C700&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/29983","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=29983"}],"version-history":[{"count":16,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/29983\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":30007,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/29983\/revisions\/30007"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/30008"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=29983"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=29983"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=29983"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=29983"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":30022,"date":"2025-09-23T08:50:08","date_gmt":"2025-09-23T12:50:08","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=30022"},"modified":"2025-09-23T08:50:09","modified_gmt":"2025-09-23T12:50:09","slug":"wld-and-wlfi","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/margin\/wld-and-wlfi","title":{"rendered":"New assets and pairs available for margin trading: WLD and WLFI!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We are making new pairs available for margin trading, taking our total to over 230 markets enabled for margin trading on Kraken Pro!<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Margin trading is now available for two new trading pairs:<br><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-table\"><table class=\"has-fixed-layout\"><tbody><tr><td>Pair base<\/td><td>Pair name<\/td><td>Available leverage<\/td><td>Limits<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>WLD<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/margin-wld-usd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WLD\/USD<\/a><\/td><td>3<\/td><td>18,000<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>WLFI<\/td><td><a href=\"https:\/\/pro.kraken.com\/app\/trade\/margin-wlfi-usd\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">WLFI\/USD<\/a><\/td><td>3<\/td><td>135,000<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Pairs are available as long only.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Started with Kraken<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-here-s-some-more-information-about-the-tokens\">Here\u2019s some more information about the tokens:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/en-es\/prices\/worldcoin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Worldcoin (WLD)<\/a> is a decentralized identity and financial network designed to provide global economic access. The project aims to enable secure identity verification, decentralized finance participation and AI-driven universal basic income (UBI). Users can store cryptocurrencies, verify identity on third-party apps, and participate in governance through WLD tokens.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/en-es\/prices\/world-liberty-financial\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">World Liberty Financial (WLFI)<\/a> is a DeFi project backed by Donald Trump and family, aiming to strengthen the role of the U.S. dollar in decentralized finance. The WLFI token is a governance token granting voting rights in protocol proposals.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-before-you-start-what-you-should-know\">Before you start, what you should know:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In order to <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/202967016-How-to-trade-using-margin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">trade using margin<\/a>, you will need to hold at least one <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/204585998-Collateral-currency\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">collateral currency<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The availability of margin trading services is subject to <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/4402532394260-Client-eligibility-for-margin-trading-services-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">certain limitations and eligibility criteria<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Margin trading incurs additional fees for opening, closing and holding a position. Learn more about the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/features\/fee-schedule#margin\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">different rates and fees<\/a>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-will-kraken-offer-more-pairs-on-margin\">Will Kraken offer more pairs on margin?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details before launch \u2013 not even which pairs we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s listed margin pairs are available <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/227876608-Margin-trading-pairs-and-their-maximum-leverage\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">on our website<\/a>. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which pairs we may be listing in the future.\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-trade-with-caution\">Trade with caution<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">There is no guarantee that a limit order will execute. There is no guarantee of margin pool availability at all times. There is also no guarantee of a market order executing at a certain price. The availability and liquidity of the particular digital asset will impact these types of orders.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Ready to trade but don\u2019t have a Kraken account yet? <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>Sign up today<\/em><\/a><em>!\u00a0<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Started with Kraken<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Availability of margin trading services is subject to <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/4402532394260-Client-eligibility-for-margin-trading-services-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>certain limitations and eligibility criteria<\/em><\/a><em>. Trading using margin involves an element of risk and may not be suitable for everyone. Read <\/em><a href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/legal#margin-disclosure-statement\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><em>Kraken&#8217;s Margin Disclosure Statement<\/em><\/a><em> to learn more.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We are making new pairs available for margin trading, taking our total to over 230 markets enabled for margin trading on Kraken Pro! Margin trading is now available for two new trading pairs: Pair base Pair name Available leverage Limits WLD WLD\/USD 3 18,000 WLFI WLFI\/USD 3 135,000 Pairs are available as long only. Get [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":30023,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1960,1794],"tags":[1491,1722],"language":[],"class_list":["post-30022","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-margin","category-pro","tag-margin-trading","tag-kraken-pro"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>New assets and pairs available for margin trading: WLD and WLFI! - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/margin\/wld-and-wlfi\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"ar