l":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","contentUrl":"https:\/\/secure.gravatar.com\/avatar\/376cf5127aff2ae0a43942a0566f9d379956601670650244112b4fdb4b8c31e3?s=96&d=identicon&r=g","caption":"KrakenFX"},"url":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/author\/alex-hatch"}]}},"jetpack_likes_enabled":false,"jetpack_sharing_enabled":true,"jetpack_shortlink":"https:\/\/wp.me\/peDd1v-7yX","jetpack_featured_media_url":"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/07\/Equities-Enhancements-Blog-Header-Consumer-3070x1400-1.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/29075","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=29075"}],"version-history":[{"count":11,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/29075\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":30178,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/29075\/revisions\/30178"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/29723"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=29075"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=29075"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=29075"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=29075"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":30184,"date":"2025-10-06T10:06:11","date_gmt":"2025-10-06T14:06:11","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=30184"},"modified":"2025-10-06T10:31:58","modified_gmt":"2025-10-06T14:31:58","slug":"trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath","title":{"rendered":"Trading Spaces recap: BTC pushes toward ATHs, ETH plays catch-up and where Dentoshi\u2019s hunting next"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Catch the full replay of our most recent Trading Spaces below or get the TL;DR in the recap that follows:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<blockquote class=\"twitter-tweet tw-align-center\"><p lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Uptober Incoming? Key Levels to Watch <a href=\"https:\/\/t.co\/PTT0NjoGxy\">https:\/\/t.co\/PTT0NjoGxy<\/a><\/p>&mdash; Kraken (@krakenfx) <a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/krakenfx\/status\/1974127355506647166?ref_src=twsrc%5Etfw\">October 3, 2025<\/a><\/blockquote> <script async src=\"https:\/\/platform.twitter.com\/widgets.js\" charset=\"utf-8\"><\/script>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-tl-dr\"><strong>TL;DR<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Majors look constructive.<\/strong> BTC is leading with <strong>bullish EMA crosses<\/strong> on lower timeframes and a strong series of higher lows. ETH has <strong>reclaimed its range<\/strong> and is building trend, albeit a touch behind BTC.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Key BTC battleground:<\/strong> Around <strong>$121K<\/strong> into prior ATH supply. <strong>Dip zones:<\/strong> mid-range support in the <strong>$116K\u2013$117.3K<\/strong> area; lose that and the mood changes.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Market structure &gt; narratives.<\/strong> Diagonals plus EMAs and clean level flips are powering Dentoshi\u2019s bias. \u201cStrong markets break and push through resistance.\u201d<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Alts need momentum.<\/strong> \u201cOthers\u201d and <strong>TOTAL3<\/strong> are working to break out of months-long ranges; <strong>BTC dominance<\/strong> may pop first (alts lag initially, then follow if breadth confirms).<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Charts we covered:<\/strong> <strong>ETHENA<\/strong> (range reclaim off the 200 EMA), <strong>XRP<\/strong> (year-long base, fresh breakout attempt), <strong>DOGE<\/strong> (slow grind, potential for violent move when it goes), <strong>PENGU<\/strong> (held higher-timeframe structure; wants a clean LTF reclaim).<br><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Bitcoin (trend: strength with shallow pullbacks)<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Context:<\/strong> After a shaky late-September, BTC <strong>printed a higher low<\/strong>, defended logical levels (e.g., January\u2019s local high), and then <strong>flipped EMAs<\/strong> bullish on lower timeframes.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"569\" data-attachment-id=\"30190\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11-18-47\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?fit=2880%2C1600&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1600\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-04 at 11.18.47\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?fit=1024%2C569&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?resize=1024%2C569&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30190\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?resize=1024%2C569&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?resize=300%2C167&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?resize=768%2C427&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?resize=1536%2C853&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?resize=2048%2C1138&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?resize=1200%2C667&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.18.47.png?resize=180%2C100&amp;ssl=1 180w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Why it matters:<\/strong> In Dentoshi\u2019s playbook, <strong>EMA cross + diagonal break + mid-range reclaim<\/strong> = momentum regime.<br><br><strong>Levels to watch<\/strong>: <strong>Resistance:<\/strong> <strong>$121K<\/strong> and prior ATH supply (wicky\/choppy is normal here).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"591\" data-attachment-id=\"30191\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11-24-29\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?fit=2880%2C1662&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1662\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-04 at 11.24.29\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?fit=1024%2C591&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?resize=1024%2C591&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30191\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?resize=1024%2C591&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?resize=300%2C173&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?resize=768%2C443&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?resize=1536%2C886&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?resize=2048%2C1182&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?resize=1200%2C693&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.24.29.png?resize=173%2C100&amp;ssl=1 173w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Support:<\/strong> <strong>$116K\u2013$117.3K<\/strong> mid-range. Lose it and we risk a bearish retest of the breakdown level that spooked the market last week.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>What we\u2019re seeing on the majors<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Ethereum (trend: improving, a step behind BTC)<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Last Trading Spaces, Dentoshi looked at this ETH setup and said \u201cIf this box breaks, we\u2019re going to trade the next box, which is where we want to start looking for longs.\u201d<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"541\" data-attachment-id=\"30192\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11-20-22\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?fit=2880%2C1522&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1522\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-04 at 11.20.22\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?fit=1024%2C541&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?resize=1024%2C541&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30192\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?resize=1024%2C541&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?resize=300%2C159&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?resize=768%2C406&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?resize=1536%2C812&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?resize=2048%2C1082&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?resize=1200%2C634&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.20.22.png?resize=189%2C100&amp;ssl=1 189w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Which is exactly what happened: We dumped into the low 3K&#8217;s \/ high 4K&#8217;s, longed those levels and then saw ETH close back inside its range, followed by a new uptrend.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"554\" data-attachment-id=\"30194\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11-22-05\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?fit=2880%2C1558&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1558\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-04 at 11.22.05\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?fit=1024%2C554&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?resize=1024%2C554&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30194\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?resize=1024%2C554&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?resize=300%2C162&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?resize=768%2C415&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?resize=1536%2C831&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?resize=2048%2C1108&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?resize=1200%2C649&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.22.05.png?resize=185%2C100&amp;ssl=1 185w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Takeaway: <strong>Majors-first leadership<\/strong> (BTC \u2192 ETH \u2192 alts) is healthier than an \u201calts-first\u201d pop. That <strong>extends<\/strong> cycles rather than blows them off prematurely.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bitcoin dominance and the altcoin backdrop<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>BTC dominance:<\/strong> Could potentially <strong>pop near-term<\/strong>, which can dent alts vs. BTC in the short window\u2014but could <strong>set the stage<\/strong> for a broader alt move later if majors hold trend.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>\u201cOthers\u201d &amp; TOTAL3:<\/strong> Both <strong>defended daily EMAs<\/strong> and are trying to <strong>print a higher high<\/strong> to escape the \u201cdoom range\u201d that\u2019s capped alts since July. Confirmation = cleaner alt beta.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Solana: strong structure, ETF chatter is a wild card<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>SOL\u2019s <strong>EMAs are aligned<\/strong>, candles constructive, but there\u2019s <strong>looming resistance<\/strong> overhead (prior highs\/ATH area).<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>On the <strong>ETF headline risk<\/strong>: short-term impact is unpredictable (sometimes <strong>\u201cbuy the rumor, sell the news\u201d<\/strong>); focus on structure first, narrative second.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"561\" data-attachment-id=\"30196\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11-26-23\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?fit=2880%2C1578&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1578\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-04 at 11.26.23\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?fit=1024%2C561&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?resize=1024%2C561&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30196\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?resize=1024%2C561&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?resize=300%2C164&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?resize=768%2C421&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?resize=1536%2C842&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?resize=2048%2C1122&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?resize=1200%2C658&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.26.23.png?resize=183%2C100&amp;ssl=1 183w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Setups we walked through<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>ETHENA<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Plan:<\/strong> Bids layered <strong>into the 200 EMA<\/strong> and range floor from last stream; <strong>daily close back inside the range<\/strong> = confirmation.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"555\" data-attachment-id=\"30198\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11-28-37\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?fit=2880%2C1560&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1560\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-04 at 11.28.37\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?fit=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?resize=1024%2C555&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30198\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?resize=1024%2C555&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?resize=300%2C163&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?resize=768%2C416&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?resize=1536%2C832&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?resize=2048%2C1109&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?resize=1200%2C650&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.28.37.png?resize=185%2C100&amp;ssl=1 185w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Still actionable zone:<\/strong> A <strong>clean LTF demand<\/strong> around range low reclaim for adds (if not already in).<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Invalidation:<\/strong> A decisive <strong>reject\/reclaim-fail<\/strong> back below the range and 200 EMA.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Targets:<\/strong> Psychological <strong>$1.00<\/strong>, mid-range <strong>$0.73<\/strong>, range highs <strong>$0.85<\/strong> \u2013 logical partials on the way up.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>XRP<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Story:<\/strong> A <strong>year-long base<\/strong> since January with EMAs respected. Fresh <strong>diagonal break<\/strong> now has room to <strong>test<\/strong> mid-\u201925 highs and the July ATH.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"590\" data-attachment-id=\"30200\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11-34-38\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?fit=2880%2C1660&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1660\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-04 at 11.34.38\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?fit=1024%2C590&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?resize=1024%2C590&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30200\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?resize=1024%2C590&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?resize=300%2C173&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?resize=768%2C443&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?resize=1536%2C885&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?resize=2048%2C1180&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?resize=1200%2C692&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.34.38.png?resize=173%2C100&amp;ssl=1 173w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Why Dentoshi likes it:<\/strong> \u201c<strong>Bigger the base, bigger the move<\/strong>.\u201d Among the few majors\/alts that <strong>kept structure<\/strong> through chop.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Caveat:<\/strong> Treat it as a <strong>fun, structured trade<\/strong> &#8212; clear invalidation and partials.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>DOGE<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Then \u2192 now: Dipped into the exact 1D MA zone <\/strong>we marked out last Trading Spaces and move up from there since.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Plan:<\/strong> Either <strong>hold\/flip<\/strong> the prior swing-high shelf for continuation <strong>or<\/strong> wait for a <strong>clean dip back<\/strong> into demand. <strong>When DOGE moves, it can move fast.<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\" noreferrer noopener\"><img data-recalc-dims=\"1\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"597\" data-attachment-id=\"30201\" data-permalink=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/crypto-education\/trading-spaces-recap-btc-toward-ath\/attachment\/screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11-31-00\" data-orig-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?fit=2880%2C1680&amp;ssl=1\" data-orig-size=\"2880,1680\" data-comments-opened=\"1\" data-image-meta=\"{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}\" data-image-title=\"Screenshot 2025-10-04 at 11.31.00\" data-image-description=\"\" data-image-caption=\"\" data-large-file=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?fit=1024%2C597&amp;ssl=1\" src=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?resize=1024%2C597&#038;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-30201\" srcset=\"https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?resize=1024%2C597&amp;ssl=1 1024w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?resize=300%2C175&amp;ssl=1 300w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?resize=768%2C448&amp;ssl=1 768w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?resize=1536%2C896&amp;ssl=1 1536w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?resize=2048%2C1195&amp;ssl=1 2048w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?resize=1200%2C700&amp;ssl=1 1200w, https:\/\/i0.wp.com\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/Screenshot-2025-10-04-at-11.31.00.png?resize=171%2C100&amp;ssl=1 171w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 1000px) 100vw, 1000px\" \/><\/a><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"height:22px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>PENGU<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Progress:<\/strong> Breakout didn\u2019t stick, but <strong>higher-timeframe structure remains<\/strong> constructive (think <strong>double-bottom vibe<\/strong> with daily EMA support).<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Trigger:<\/strong> <strong>LTF EMAs crossing up<\/strong> + reclaim of the recent breakdown shelf. Watch the <strong>yearly open<\/strong> and local highs as first supply.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>The process: Dentoshi\u2019s \u201cif\/then\u201d method<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>If<\/strong> majors <strong>hold<\/strong> mid-range + EMAs \u2192 <strong>then<\/strong> press longs\/continuations.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>If<\/strong> mid-range <strong>fails<\/strong> \u2192 <strong>then<\/strong> step aside and look for the <strong>next<\/strong> demand level; don\u2019t round-trip profits.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>If<\/strong> breadth (TOTAL3\/\u201cOthers\u201d) <strong>breaks and holds<\/strong> \u2192 <strong>then<\/strong> expand into <strong>alt beta<\/strong>.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">This \u201c<strong>if\/then<\/strong>\u201d framing keeps emotions in check and turns entries\/exits into&nbsp;<strong>simple, falsifiable<\/strong>&nbsp;decisions.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-playbook-for-the-next-1-2-weeks\"><strong>Playbook for the next 1-2 weeks<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Respect the levels.<\/strong> BTC showing strong signs of momentum above <strong>$121K<\/strong> = green light. A <strong>cool-off<\/strong> (time-based or a small price dip) is fine <em>as long as<\/em> the <strong>$116K\u2013$117.3K<\/strong> mid-range holds.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Majors first.<\/strong> Let <strong>BTC lead<\/strong>, <strong>ETH confirm<\/strong>, then <strong>select alts<\/strong>.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Breadth confirmation.<\/strong> Want <strong>TOTAL3\/\u201cOthers\u201d<\/strong> to break and <em>hold<\/em> above supply.<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Two entry archetypes only:<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong>\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Breakout-strength<\/strong> (fresh highs + HL support on LTF).<br><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Retest-logic<\/strong> (flush into pre-mapped demand with rising EMAs beneath).<br><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Risk management:<\/strong> Position so that your <strong>invalidation = known % of portfolio risk<\/strong>. No hero sizing into resistance.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Final word<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Right now,&nbsp;<strong>the market looks the way you&nbsp;<\/strong><strong><em>want<\/em><\/strong>&nbsp;it to look when BTC is leading:&nbsp;<strong>shallow pullbacks, easy EMA flips, strength through resistance.<\/strong>&nbsp;If that continues,&nbsp;<strong>ETH and select alts<\/strong>&nbsp;should follow. If the mid-range gives way,&nbsp;<strong>respect it<\/strong>&nbsp;and rotate to the next plan.&nbsp;<strong>Let the market come to your levels.<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Watch the replays and catch the next session on X:<\/strong><strong><br><\/strong>Follow&nbsp;<strong>@krakenfx<\/strong>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<strong>@krakenpro<\/strong>&nbsp;for stream times and highlights.<br>Want more of Dentoshi\u2019s process? See our recent recaps and deep dives.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Trade smarter on Kraken Pro.<\/strong>&nbsp;Build watchlists, set alerts, and trade with advanced order types. (Availability varies by region.)<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/kraken.pxf.io\/c\/5984839\/1589189\/10583\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Trade with Dentoshi on Kraken Pro<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>BTC knocking out all-time highs, ETH gearing up to follow and Dentoshi\u2019s calling the plays &#8212; here\u2019s what the pro trader is seeing as the next leg of the rally takes off.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":30188,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1391,1794],"tags":[1946,1722,1476],"language":[],"class_list":["post-30184","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-crypto-education","category-pro","tag-dentoshi","tag-kraken-pro","tag-trading"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Trading Spaces recap: BTC pushes toward ATHs, ETH plays catch-up and where Dentoshi\u2019s hunting next - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-sni