-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-aptos\"},\"author\":{\"name\":\"KrakenFX\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#\\\/schema\\\/person\\\/87e55a5e8ea020a6e620192589a05abf\"},\"headline\":\"USDT deposits and withdrawals now available on Aptos!\",\"datePublished\":\"2025-10-09T12:14:21+00:00\",\"dateModified\":\"2025-10-09T12:14:22+00:00\",\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/new-features\\\/usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-aptos\"},\"wordCount\":339,\"commentCount\":0,\"publisher\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#organization\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/new-features\\\/usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-aptos#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https:\\\/\\\/i0.wp.com\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/wp-content\\\/uploads\\\/2025\\\/10\\\/blog-aptos-u.png?fit=3070%2C1400&ssl=1\",\"keywords\":[\"Kraken\",\"stablecoins\",\"trading\"],\"articleSection\":[\"New Features\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"potentialAction\":[{\"@type\":\"CommentAction\",\"name\":\"Comment\",\"target\":[\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/new-features\\\/usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-aptos#respond\"]}]},{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/new-features\\\/usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-aptos\",\"url\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/new-features\\\/usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-aptos\",\"name\":\"USDT deposits and withdrawals now available on Aptos! - Kraken Blog\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/#website\"},\"primaryImageOfPage\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/new-features\\\/usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-aptos#primaryimage\"},\"image\":{\"@id\":\"https:\\\/\\\/blog.kraken.com\\\/product\\\/new-features\\\/usdt-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-aptos#primaryimage\"},\"thumbnailUrl\":\"https