ref":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/230089386"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=30292"}],"version-history":[{"count":1,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/30292\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":30295,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/30292\/revisions\/30295"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/30293"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=30292"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=30292"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=30292"},{"taxonomy":"language","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/language?post=30292"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}},{"id":30302,"date":"2025-10-14T12:28:09","date_gmt":"2025-10-14T16:28:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/?p=30302"},"modified":"2025-10-14T12:30:01","modified_gmt":"2025-10-14T16:30:01","slug":"usdc-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-ink","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-features\/usdc-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-ink","title":{"rendered":"USDC deposits and withdrawals now available on Ink!"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports deposits and withdrawals of USDC on Ink!\u00a0<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-funding\"><strong>Funding<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">USDC funding via Ink is already live. You can transfer USDC to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting USDC and choosing the desired deposit method (network) from the drop-down box: <strong>Ink<\/strong>.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Make sure to deposit your tokens into networks supported by Kraken. Deposits made using other networks will be lost.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/app.kraken.com\/JDNW\/INK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Deposit on Kraken<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-here-s-some-more-information-about-usdc-and-ink\">Here\u2019s some more information about USDC and Ink<strong>:<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-usdc-usdc\">USDC (USDC)<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">USDC is designed to track the value of the U.S. dollar while enabling faster and more cost-effective transactions than traditional banks. It operates across multiple networks, including Ethereum, Solana, Sui, Avalanche, Ink and others. According to Circle, each USDC is backed by an equivalent value of U.S. dollar-denominated assets.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-ink\">Ink<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Ink is an Ethereum layer 2 blockchain, built on the OP Stack, designed to be the house of DeFi for the Superchain. Ink will empower onchain builders to deploy new and innovative DeFi protocols for the next billion users onchain, securing the protocol via staking and voting on decisions that affect the future of the platform.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Please note:&nbsp;&nbsp;<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Trading via Kraken App and Instant Buy will be available once the liquidity conditions are met<\/strong><em> (when a sufficient number of buyers and sellers have entered the market for their orders to be efficiently matched).<\/em><\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Geographic restrictions may apply<\/strong><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div style=\"width: 100%; height: auto; text-align: center;\"><a class=\"btn btn-primary\" style=\"display: inline-block; padding: 12px 32px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; text-decoration: none; transition: opacity 0.2s linear 0s; line-height: 24px; border-radius: 90px; color: #FFFFFF; background-color: #5D45DC; border: 1px solid #5D45DC;\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kraken.com\/sign-up\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get Started with Kraken<\/a><\/div>\n<div>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" id=\"h-will-kraken-make-more-assets-available\"><strong>Will Kraken make more assets available?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Yes! But our policy is to never reveal any details until shortly before launch \u2013 including which assets we are considering. All of Kraken\u2019s available tokens can be found <a href=\"https:\/\/support.kraken.com\/hc\/en-us\/articles\/360000678446-Cryptocurrencies-available-on-Kraken\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">here<\/a>, and all future tokens will be announced on our <a href=\"http:\/\/kraken.com\/listings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Listings Roadmap<\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/x.com\/krakenfx\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">social media profiles<\/a>. Our client engagement specialists cannot answer any questions about which assets we may be making available in the future.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>Although the term &#8220;stablecoin&#8221; is commonly used, there is no guarantee that the asset will maintain a stable value in relation to the value of the reference asset when traded on secondary markets or that the reserve of assets, if there is one, will be adequate to satisfy all redemptions.<\/em><\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports deposits and withdrawals of USDC on Ink!\u00a0 Funding USDC funding via Ink is already live. You can transfer USDC to your Kraken account by navigating to Funding, selecting USDC and choosing the desired deposit method (network) from the drop-down box: Ink. Make sure to deposit your tokens [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":230089386,"featured_media":30303,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_jetpack_newsletter_access":"","_jetpack_dont_email_post_to_subs":false,"_jetpack_newsletter_tier_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paywalled_content":false,"_wpcom_ai_launchpad_first_post":false,"_jetpack_feature_clip_id":0,"_jetpack_memberships_contains_paid_content":false,"footnotes":"","jetpack_post_was_ever_published":false},"categories":[1790],"tags":[1403,1901,1476],"language":[],"class_list":["post-30302","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-new-features","tag-kraken","tag-stablecoins","tag-trading"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO Premium plugin v23.2 (Yoast SEO v28.5) - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-premium-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>USDC deposits and withdrawals now available on Ink! - Kraken Blog<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/blog.kraken.com\/product\/new-features\/usdc-deposits-and-withdrawals-now-available-on-ink\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"USDC deposits and withdrawals now available on Ink!\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"We\u2019re thrilled to announce that Kraken now supports deposits and withdrawals of USDC on Ink!\u00a0 